        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dogs are man’s best friend. But when their owners leave home for work, the dogs may feel lonely at home. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The “phone” is a soft ball. A dog can start a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "video call",
            "zh": "视频电话"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the computer by moving the ball. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " They can also place a call to their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pet",
            "ref": "v-pet"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ilyena Hirskyj-Douglas is the inventor. She has a pet dog named Zack. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " He used it for 16 days when his “mum” wasn’t home. Sometimes, Zack would call her, but didn’t look "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "interested",
            "ref": "v-interested"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " during the video call."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Maybe one day, dogs will be able to call each other on Facebark!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "bark意为“狗的叫声”，发音跟back和book有点相似。本文标题为give sb. a call back（给某人回电）的化用，文章最后的Facebark则化用自Facebook（脸书）。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
